      "writtenOn": "2017-01-20T19:48:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this something imposed on us by supplicant? (From a caller perspective, it seems like things would be simpler for addExtRadioWork() start to simply block until the radio is free. But I don\u0027t know if we have the freedom to go that way.)",
