      "writtenOn": "2017-01-20T20:19:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah. This is how supplicant\u0027s radio handling is handled in ctrl_iface.c: https://cs.corp.google.com/android/external/wpa_supplicant_8/wpa_supplicant/ctrl_iface.c?rcl\u003d3529f418fa26d5c14af5cdfeb0111b7e35108c2a\u0026l\u003d7428.\n\nSince wpa_supplicant is single threaded, we cannot block the HIDL method call because that will prevent the radio work scheduled being processed (from the eloop).",
