        "id": 1081399
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-01-20T19:48:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what this means. Is the point here that it\u0027s okay (and meaningful) to call removeExtRadioWork() in between the time that someone calls addExtRadioWork(), and the time when they receive the onExtRadioWorkStart() callback? Or is the point that we\u0027re allowed to remove radio work even before calling addExtRadioWork()?\n\nI don\u0027t think it\u0027s the latter, as I don\u0027t understand how that would work. But, at present, the meaning of this sentence is unclear. Assuming the first theory is correct, I\u0027d recommend revising this sentence to explicitly talk about onExtRadioWorkStart().",
